    # Let's track the process year by year.
    # Year 1: Alien 1 becomes an adult. 
    # Every adult (there are none at year 0) gives a stone.
    # Year 2: Alien 2 becomes an adult.
    # Every adult (Alien 1) who has >= 1 stone gives a stone to Alien 2.
    # Year 3: Alien 3 becomes an adult.
    # Every adult (Alien 1, Alien 2) who has >= 1 stone gives a stone to Alien 3.
    
    # Observation:
    # At year t, alien t becomes an adult.
    # Before year t, aliens 1 to t-1 have already become adults.
    # At year t, if alien j (j < t) has C_j > 0, C_j decreases by 1 and C_t increases by 1.
    # This means C_t = A_t + (number of j < t such that C_j > 0 at year t).
    # Also, C_j = A_j - (number of k > j such that C_j > 0 at year k).
    
